type: software
title: "catchment"
abstract: "Given a DEM, catchment dervies channel initiation points (from flowlines or a contributing-area threshold), and produces a hydrologically conditioned DEM, flow direction/accumulation, labeled channel network, subbasins, reaches, HAND, and the vectorized stream network."
